(3, 10, 3, 'preference', NULL, NULL, 'User preference', 'There should be 2 different wattages for this project in the project_wattage_orders table that shows the wattages and quantities for this project. This is how you got the total. I want you to send me the individual wattages and quantities for those wattages', 1, '2025-07-02 08:23:07', '2025-07-02 08:23:07'),
